                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Great game.  The bones are solid, I hope the dev keeps working on it and building more.  This is the closest I've come to feeling like I'm playing Total War in Space.  Just needs more management on the grand scale, and more variability in the tactical side.  Would love to see a galactic conquest version with planets and stuff to fight over.  Like Empire at War, but turn based.  (We don't need land combat though.)",
